4. Sample Test Cases

Test Case	Input/Action	Expected Result

TC01	Enter valid login details	User successfully logs in
TC02	Enter incorrect password	Error message is displayed
TC03	Enter a valid story prompt	AI generates a story
TC04	Submit empty prompt	Validation message is displayed
TC05	Generate characters	Character details are generated
TC06	Generate comic panels	Story is divided into panels
TC07	Edit dialogue	Updated dialogue is displayed
TC08	Save comic	Comic is successfully saved
TC09	Open saved comic	Previously saved comic is displayed
TC10	Delete comic	Selected comic is removed
TC11	Gemini API failure	Appropriate error message is displayed
TC12	Export comic	Comic is exported successfully


5. Expected Testing Result

After completing testing, ComicCraft should successfully generate AI-based comic stories from user prompts, create structured comic panels, allow users to edit and save their work, and handle errors appropriately.

6. Conclusion

Testing ensures that ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator using Gemini Models is functional, reliable, secure, and user-friendly. Successful completion of all test cases confirms that the system satisfies its project requirements.
